{"id":"mdn-36d1847e5cf726c7","html":"<p>La fonction <code>true</code> retourne la valeur booléenne <code>true</code>.</p>\n<h3>Syntaxe</h3>\n<pre><code>true()\n</code></pre>\n<h3>Retour</h3>\n<p>Le booléen <code>true</code>.</p>\n<h3>Définition</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/xpath#function-true\">XPath 1.0, section 4.3</a>.</p>\n<h3>Support Gecko</h3>\n<p>Supportée.</p>\n","attribution":"MDN Web Docs et ses contributeurs","sourceUrl":"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/XML/XPath/Reference/Functions/true","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","changes":"Mise en forme pour Nunya ; macros interactives et images distantes omises. Le texte n’a pas été aligné au programme togolais.","resource":{"id":"mdn-36d1847e5cf726c7","title":"true","s":"tech","t":"web","p":"mdn","f":"article","c":"API & technologies du web","u":"","d":60,"l":"reference","v":"","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/XML/XPath/Reference/Functions/true","b":239},"related":[{"id":"mdn-9d77d1292659b6d9","title":"translate","f":"article"},{"id":"mdn-0edfd889fe74d4c0","title":"unparsed-entity-url","f":"article"},{"id":"mdn-c0c2f75f402a1940","title":"Paramètres des instructions de traitement","f":"article"}]}